# Functional Programming Guidelines

- All services and utilities must use a functional approach rather than class-based
- Use named function exports for individual functions
- Provide default combined exports for easier imports
- Follow pure function principles whenever possible
- Always handle errors with try/catch in services

## Service Export Pattern

```typescript
// Individual exports
